Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:09.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:17.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}翻譯＆校對：cz@阿羅拖拉機  時後：萌新時刻準備擺爛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:02.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:05.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,請讓我成為你們隊伍的贊助！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:08.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我想為你們加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:19.63,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這拍得真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真勁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:26.58,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,勁？什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.80,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那是只是碰巧拍下的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是嗎  拍得真有那個味道了  真不愧是專業的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.37,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,亞梨子要看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:36.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,喂  靠太近啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:43.67,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,小悠  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,有客人來了  悠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:49.90,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你好！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:51.90,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我叫真賀孝哉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:53.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你是那時的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:56.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這下厲害了  悠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.19,0:00:58.49,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,他被你駕駛的樣子迷住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.91,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,就來找我們想要做贊助商呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.81,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:04.51,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好像是在東京做攝影師呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:08.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,因為拍的是照片  所以應該叫攝像師
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,也拍了你昨天的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:18.35,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,對吧  很色吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:22.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,大叔  不是色  是勁啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,居然說成了色  真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:30.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,等下  這是討飯吃的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:34.08,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,分期還沒還完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,——OP——
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",-300,50)!{\pos($scenter,$smiddle)\an5\1a&Hff\3a&HFF\4a&HFF\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+50!,\1a&HFF\3a&H00\4a&H00)\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)+200!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+300!,\1a&H00\3a&Hff\bord0\4a&H00)}
